((=- Latex template with pandoc captionless-longtable support.

Pandoc >= 3.8 emits ``\def\LTcaptype{none}`` for tables without captions.
Modern longtable then steps a counter named ``none``. Pandoc's own default
template defines that counter; nbconvert's stock latex template does not
(see jupyter/nbconvert#2254).

Extend the stock latex entry point by path so this file does not recurse on
itself (``index.tex.j2`` would resolve to this directory first). -=))

((*- extends 'latex/index.tex.j2' -*))

((* block packages *))
((( super() )))
% Dummy counter for pandoc captionless longtables (\LTcaptype{none}).
\newcounter{none}
((* endblock packages *))
